00:00.000 --> 00:03.900
A large pale moon hangs in the dark sky.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.650
Dark SeeD landing craft streak across the face of the moon, trailing wakes.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.900
A glowing blue shape glides low over the water.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.780
SeeD landing craft speed across the sea beneath an orange dusk.

00:38.000 --> 00:45.830
